From: postmarketOS gs101 port
Subject: [PATCH] pipeline: simple: enable gs101-mipi-csis (Tensor/Pixel 6)

The gs101 (Google Tensor) MIPI-CSIS receiver exposes raw Bayer capture
video nodes with no hardware converter, so route it through the simple
pipeline handler with the Software ISP for debayering.

--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
@@ -257,6 +257,7 @@
 
 static const SimplePipelineInfo supportedDevices[] = {
 	{ "dcmipp", {}, false },
+	{ "gs101-mipi-csis", {}, true },
 	{ "imx7-csi", { { "pxp", 1 } }, true },
 	{ "intel-ipu6", {}, true },
 	{ "intel-ipu7", {}, true },
